  "runtime_notes": [
    "Suggested volumes are initial estimates, not calibrated in game.",
    "idle_loop is silent when ammunition is zero; spin_loop and spin_fast_loop are alternative layers, not simultaneous defaults.",
    "Loop bounds are [0, sample_frames); fade voices on normal transitions and stop immediately if no frame-driven fade is possible.",
    "gold_explosion_low and gold_explosion_full are endpoints for charge-dependent design, not simultaneous full-volume play.",
    "A preview must not claim real-game listening or user approval.",
    "Trigger early_release only for an incomplete charge; never combine it with the throw or explosion cue.",
    "Trigger ground_contact only for an actual validated landing; skip it if the event cannot be observed reliably.",
    "Trigger charge_ready once when crossing the full-charge threshold, not once per frame.",
    "For a first integration prefer one spin_loop voice with pitch updated smoothly; compare the alternate loop during user review."
  ],
